# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AquaCast-Punjab.zip is regenerated on every release; keep it out of history
# so the repo doesn't carry a new 10 MB binary per commit. Attach it to a
# GitHub Release instead (instructions in README / below).
AquaCast-Punjab.zip

# Regenerated by scripts/make_figures.py and scripts/build_deck.py
reports/figures/*.png
!reports/figures/.gitkeep

# Trained weights are reproducible with `python run_pipeline.py` (~40 s).
# Uncomment the next line if you would rather ship them.
# models/lstm_aquifer.pth

